{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BhKwKFxOh21794411471.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市個別發展，納斯達克指數造好，道瓊斯工業平均指數早段則跌逾100點。</p><p></p><p>納指高開逾300點後，升幅曾經擴大至近450點，升穿25,500點。</p><p></p><p>科技股普遍向好，新型雲端企業CoreWeave上季業績好過預期，股價升約兩成，升至59美元水平。晶片股美光科技和閃迪升百分之9至12。英特爾升近百分之6。連跌多日的輝達反彈約百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:41:30.716492+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T20:57:31.909408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:34:43.459751+00:00","content_hash":"6e212e30d24387972db3cb88ed98ef00415ff6e1af93509ffc1fef0985f4bb4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:41:30.716492+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}